        "answer": {
          "short": "$f'(x)=\\dfrac{5\\sqrt[4]{x}}{4}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}f'(x)&=\\frac54x^{5/4-1}\\\\f'(x)&=\\frac54x^{1/4}\\\\f'(x)&=\\frac{5\\sqrt[4]{x}}4\\end{aligned}$$",
