        "answer": {
          "short": "$f'(x)=-\\dfrac{5}{2\\sqrt{x^3}}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}f'(x)&=5\\left(-\\frac12\\right)x^{-1/2-1}\\\\f'(x)&=-\\frac52x^{-3/2}\\\\f'(x)&=-\\frac{5}{2\\sqrt{x^3}}\\end{aligned}$$",
